  "body": "  Q-4: Which javascript statement correctly creates a new entry for a list?      document.body.ol.innerHTML = \"<li>\"    No, There is no document.body.ol      myLi = \"#newli\"    This just assigns a string to a variable      document.createElement(\"li\")    Yes      myOl.appendChild(\"li\")    No, appendChild does not create an element     "
